          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-4-sec-8-3-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "38af9b98154a9df1f572a49e25fc55a1db42233af9839d3fe44a3aabc7a2bb40",
      "skos:note": "Conditional commencement of provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009#sch-4-sec-8-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 Schedule 3,",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "items 111 to 114\nThe later of:\n(a) the start of the 28th day after the day on\nwhich this Act receives the Royal\nAssent; and\n(b) immediately after the commencement of\nparagraph 135(1)(b) of the Fair Work\nAct 2009.\nHowever, the provision(s) do not commence\nat all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b)\ndoes not occur."
    },
