      "values:originalText": "items 115 and 116\nThe later of:\n(a) the start of the 28th day after the day on\nwhich this Act receives the Royal\nAssent; and\n(b) immediately after the commencement of\nitem 82 of Schedule 2 to the Same-Sex\nRelationships (Equal Treatment in\nCommonwealth Laws—General Law\nReform) Act 2008.\nHowever, the provision(s) do not commence\nat all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b)\ndoes not occur.",
      "skos:definition": "items 115 and 116\nThe later of:\n(a) the start of the 28th day after the day on\nwhich this Act receives the Royal\nAssent; and\n(b) immediately after the commencement of\nitem 82 of Schedule 2 to the Same-Sex\nRelationships (Equal Treatment in\nCommonwealth Laws—General Law\nReform) Act 2008.\nHowever, the provision(s) do not commence\nat all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b)\ndoes not occur.",
      "cml:asserts": [
