        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b1830f95d8b27f79302d3a8bf1efb4c88ecaeaa3aae4641393fe43ab881ad2fe",
      "skos:note": "Conditional commencement of provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009#sch-4-sec-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9 Schedule 3,",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "items 115 and 116\nThe later of:\n(a) the start of the 28th day after the day on\nwhich this Act receives the Royal\nAssent; and\n(b) immediately after the commencement of\nitem 82 of Schedule 2 to the Same-Sex\nRelationships (Equal Treatment in\nCommonwealth Laws—General Law\nReform) Act 2008.\nHowever, the provision(s) do not commence\nat all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b)\ndoes not occur."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-4-sec-9-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
