    {
      "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-1-sec-16",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16 Act done because of age and for other reason",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009#sch-1-sec-16"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) an act is done for 2 or more reasons; and\n\n(b) one of the reasons (whether or not it is the dominant or a\nsubstantial reason) is:\n\n(i) the age of a person; or\n\n(ii) a characteristic that appertains generally to persons of\nthe age of a person; or\n\n(iii) a characteristic that is generally imputed to persons of\nthe age of a person.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, the act referred to in paragraph (1)(a)\nis taken to be done because of the age of the person.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) an act is done for 2 or more reasons; and\n\n(b) one of the reasons (whether or not it is the dominant or a\nsubstantial reason) is:\n\n(i) the age of a person; or\n\n(ii) a characteristic that appertains generally to persons of\nthe age of a person; or\n\n(iii) a characteristic that is generally imputed to persons of\nthe age of a person.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, the act referred to in paragraph (1)(a)\nis taken to be done because of the age of the person.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-1-sec-16-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-1-sec-16-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8b901c72c22862c071feb94dbded2d88c9877a7902b5ffb7752a72731c11859f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009#sch-1-sec-16",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16 Act done because of age and for other reason",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) an act is done for 2 or more reasons; and\n\n(b) one of the reasons (whether or not it is the dominant or a\nsubstantial reason) is:\n\n(i) the age of a person; or\n\n(ii) a characteristic that appertains generally to persons of\nthe age of a person; or\n\n(iii) a characteristic that is generally imputed to persons of\nthe age of a person.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, the act referred to in paragraph (1)(a)\nis taken to be done because of the age of the person."
    },
