      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this Act, a disability aid, in relation to a person\nwith a disability, is equipment (including a palliative or therapeutic\ndevice) that:\n\n(a) is used by the person; and\n\n(b) provides assistance to alleviate the effect of the disability.\nHaving a carer, assistant, assistance animal or disability aid",
