      "dc:source": "disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "Having a carer, assistant, assistance animal or disability aid\nItem\nFor the purposes of\nthis Act, a person with\na disability has …\nif the person …\na carer or assistant\n(a) is presently accompanied by the carer or\nassistant; or\n(b) was previously accompanied by the carer or\nassistant; or\n(c) may be accompanied by the carer or assistant\nin the future; or\n(d) is imputed to be accompanied by the carer or\nassistant.\nan assistance animal or\ndisability aid\n(a) is presently accompanied by, or possesses,\nthe animal or aid; or\n(b) was previously accompanied by, or\npossessed, the animal or aid; or\n(c) may be accompanied by, or possess, the\nanimal or aid in the future; or\n(d) is imputed to be accompanied by, or to\npossess, the animal or aid.",
      "skos:definition": "Having a carer, assistant, assistance animal or disability aid\nItem\nFor the purposes of\nthis Act, a person with\na disability has …\nif the person …\na carer or assistant\n(a) is presently accompanied by the carer or\nassistant; or\n(b) was previously accompanied by the carer or\nassistant; or\n(c) may be accompanied by the carer or assistant\nin the future; or\n(d) is imputed to be accompanied by the carer or\nassistant.\nan assistance animal or\ndisability aid\n(a) is presently accompanied by, or possesses,\nthe animal or aid; or\n(b) was previously accompanied by, or\npossessed, the animal or aid; or\n(c) may be accompanied by, or possess, the\nanimal or aid in the future; or\n(d) is imputed to be accompanied by, or to\npossess, the animal or aid.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-2009-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-2009-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-2009-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-2009-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-2009-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-2009-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f6a35c37882e1a0fc59e246a26a3dddd54583a6d398aa65de9e1815572d45f1e",
      "skos:note": "A person with a disability must be accompanied by their carer or assistant."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009#sch-2-sec-2009",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2009 11",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "Having a carer, assistant, assistance animal or disability aid\nItem\nFor the purposes of\nthis Act, a person with\na disability has …\nif the person …\na carer or assistant\n(a) is presently accompanied by the carer or\nassistant; or\n(b) was previously accompanied by the carer or\nassistant; or\n(c) may be accompanied by the carer or assistant\nin the future; or\n(d) is imputed to be accompanied by the carer or\nassistant.\nan assistance animal or\ndisability aid\n(a) is presently accompanied by, or possesses,\nthe animal or aid; or\n(b) was previously accompanied by, or\npossessed, the animal or aid; or\n(c) may be accompanied by, or possess, the\nanimal or aid in the future; or\n(d) is imputed to be accompanied by, or to\npossess, the animal or aid."
    },
