      },
      "dc:source": "disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(2) This Part does not require an employment agency to ensure that an\nemployer complies with this Act.\n\n(3) Subsection (2) does not affect the operation of section 122 (which\napplies if an employment agency causes, instructs, induces, aids or\npermits an employer to do an unlawful act).",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(2) This Part does not require an employment agency to ensure that an\nemployer complies with this Act.\n\n(3) Subsection (2) does not affect the operation of section 122 (which\napplies if an employment agency causes, instructs, induces, aids or\npermits an employer to do an unlawful act).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-40-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-40-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fc61fc4a50e655d12b70c909f99174b3a8932dca19bfcf9d8128e3cad72db45b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009#sch-2-sec-40",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40 Subsection 21(2)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(2) This Part does not require an employment agency to ensure that an\nemployer complies with this Act.\n\n(3) Subsection (2) does not affect the operation of section 122 (which\napplies if an employment agency causes, instructs, induces, aids or\npermits an employer to do an unlawful act)."
    },
