      "values:originalText": "(2) It is unlawful for the first person to request or require the other\nperson to provide information (whether by completing a form or\notherwise) if:\n\nSchedule 2  Disability discrimination"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-30-2-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
