    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009#sch-2-sec-31-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "31 Disability standards",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 22,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, formulate standards,\nto be known as disability standards, in relation to any area in\nwhich it is unlawful under this Part for a person to discriminate\n\nDisability discrimination  Schedule 2\nAmendments commencing 28 days after Royal Assent  Part 1\n\nDisability Discrimination and Other Human Rights Legislation Amendment Act"
    },
