      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a disability standard may:\n\n(a) deal with the following:\n\n(i) reasonable adjustments;\n\n(ii) strategies and programs to prevent harassment or\nvictimisation of persons with a disability;\n\n(iii) unjustifiable hardship;\n\n(iv) exemptions from the disability standard, including the\npower (if any) of the Commission to grant such\nexemptions; or\n\n(b) provide that the disability standard, in whole or in part, is or\nis not intended to affect the operation of a law of a State or\nTerritory.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a disability standard may:\n\n(a) deal with the following:\n\n(i) reasonable adjustments;\n\n(ii) strategies and programs to prevent harassment or\nvictimisation of persons with a disability;\n\n(iii) unjustifiable hardship;\n\n(iv) exemptions from the disability standard, including the\npower (if any) of the Commission to grant such\nexemptions; or\n\n(b) provide that the disability standard, in whole or in part, is or\nis not intended to affect the operation of a law of a State or\nTerritory.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-2009-5"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-2009-5-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c1cdd6f9decd0521444f502e0bb1436d15bc448b161003f2d1573e0cd948053d",
      "skos:note": "Disability standard may deal with certain aspects"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009#sch-2-sec-2009-5-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2009(2) 19",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 23,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a disability standard may:\n\n(a) deal with the following:\n\n(i) reasonable adjustments;\n\n(ii) strategies and programs to prevent harassment or\nvictimisation of persons with a disability;\n\n(iii) unjustifiable hardship;\n\n(iv) exemptions from the disability standard, including the\npower (if any) of the Commission to grant such\nexemptions; or\n\n(b) provide that the disability standard, in whole or in part, is or\nis not intended to affect the operation of a law of a State or\nTerritory."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-2009-5-ss-2-norm",
