    {
      "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-71",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "71 At the end of section 45",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009#sch-2-sec-71"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(2) However, subsection (1) does not apply:\n\n(a) in relation to discrimination in implementing a measure\nreferred to in that subsection if the discrimination is not\nnecessary for implementing the measure; or\n\n(b) in relation to the rates of salary or wages paid to persons with\ndisabilities.\nNote:\nFor discrimination in relation to the rates of salary or wages paid to\npersons with disabilities, see paragraphs 47(1)(c) and (d).",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n(2) However, subsection (1) does not apply:\n\n(a) in relation to discrimination in implementing a measure\nreferred to in that subsection if the discrimination is not\nnecessary for implementing the measure; or\n\n(b) in relation to the rates of salary or wages paid to persons with\ndisabilities.\nNote:\nFor discrimination in relation to the rates of salary or wages paid to\npersons with disabilities, see paragraphs 47(1)(c) and (d).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-71-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-71-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7843659281cfe9c33a069becf16963781d48d62a42bb73953c32111fbeb443d5",
      "skos:note": "Exemption from discrimination in implementing a measure not necessary for its implementation or in relation to rates of salary or wages paid to persons with disabilities."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009#sch-2-sec-71",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "71 At the end of section 45",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 24,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(2) However, subsection (1) does not apply:\n\n(a) in relation to discrimination in implementing a measure\nreferred to in that subsection if the discrimination is not\nnecessary for implementing the measure; or\n\n(b) in relation to the rates of salary or wages paid to persons with\ndisabilities.\nNote:\nFor discrimination in relation to the rates of salary or wages paid to\npersons with disabilities, see paragraphs 47(1)(c) and (d)."
    },
