      "dc:source": "disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "(2) This Part does not render it unlawful for a person to request or to\nrequire that the assistance animal remain under the control of:\n\n(a) the person with the disability; or\n\n(b) another person on behalf of the person with the disability.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) This Part does not render it unlawful for a person to request or to\nrequire that the assistance animal remain under the control of:\n\n(a) the person with the disability; or\n\n(b) another person on behalf of the person with the disability.",
