      },
      "dc:source": "disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of subsection (2), an assistance animal may be\nunder the control of a person even if it is not under the person’s\ndirect physical control.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of subsection (2), an assistance animal may be\nunder the control of a person even if it is not under the person’s\ndirect physical control.",
      "values:partOf": {
