      },
      "dc:source": "disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies in relation to an action plan:\n\n(a) given to the Commission under section 64 of the Disability\nDiscrimination Act 1992; and\n\n(b) in force immediately before the commencement of this Part.\n(2)\nThe action plan has effect, from the commencement of this Part, as if it\nhad been given to the Commission under that section as amended by\nthis Part.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies in relation to an action plan:\n\n(a) given to the Commission under section 64 of the Disability\nDiscrimination Act 1992; and\n\n(b) in force immediately before the commencement of this Part.\n(2)\nThe action plan has effect, from the commencement of this Part, as if it\nhad been given to the Commission under that section as amended by\nthis Part.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-86-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "169f8abecdf4466f7f243b63cf468309c58ea66920bf591607dae009235ba96b",
      "skos:note": "Saving—action plans"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009#sch-2-sec-86",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "86 Saving—action plans",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 27,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies in relation to an action plan:\n\n(a) given to the Commission under section 64 of the Disability\nDiscrimination Act 1992; and\n\n(b) in force immediately before the commencement of this Part.\n(2)\nThe action plan has effect, from the commencement of this Part, as if it\nhad been given to the Commission under that section as amended by\nthis Part."
