      "values:originalText": "Omit “Human Rights and Equal Opportunity Commission Act 1986”,\nsubstitute “Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986”.\nNote:\nThe heading to section 161 is altered by omitting “HREOC” and substituting\n“Australian Human Rights Commission”.\n\nSchedule 3  Australian Human Rights Commission",
